                      "contentmodel": "wikitext",
                      "contentformat": "text/x-wiki",
                      "*": "{{#babel:en-N|PH-1}}\nI'm an amateur hobby photographer. I have a DSLR and an interest in [[w:Winnipeg, Manitoba|Winnipeg, Manitoba]]'s downtown area, architecture and local events. I am open to constructive criticism. \n\n<gallery>\nFile:Johnston Terminal at the Forks Winnipeg.jpg|Johnston Terminal at [[w:The Forks, Winnipeg|The Forks]] ([[w:Winnipeg, Manitoba|Winnipeg]])\nFile:Buildings in Downtown Regina as seen from Victoria Park.jpg|Office buildings in Downtown [[w:Regina, Saskatchewan|Regina, Saskatchewan]] as seen from Victoria Park\nFile:Stephen Juba Park and Condominiums in Winnipeg's Waterfront District in fall.JPG|[[w:Stephen Juba Park|Stephen Juba Park]] and Condominiums in [[w:Winnipeg, Manitoba|Winnipeg]]'s Waterfront District\nFile:Entrance to Concordia Village I, 1125 Molson St, Winnipeg, Manitoba.jpg|Entrance to [[w:Concordia Hospital|Concordia Village I]] ([[w:Winnipeg, Manitoba|Winnipeg]])\nFile:Winnipeg Millennium Library and emptyful sculpture 01.JPG|[[w:Millennium Library (Winnipeg)|Millennium Library]] and ''emptyful'' sculpture ([[w:Winnipeg, Manitoba|Winnipeg]])\nFile:Downtown Winnipeg skyline as seen from The Forks market tower in winter.JPG|Downtown [[w:Winnipeg, Manitoba|Winnipeg]] skyline\nFile:First World War Memorial statue in front of Bank of Montreal.JPG|First World War Memorial at [[w:Portage and Main|Portage and Main]]\nFile:Capoeira at Brazilian pavilion at Folklorama 2013.jpg|Winnipeg's [[w:Folklorama|Folklorama]] festival\nFile:McDermot Ave in Winnipeg's East Exchange District.JPG|McDermot Ave in Winnipeg's [[w:Exchange District|Exchange District]]\nFile:Red River College Roblin Centre from William and Adelaide.jpg|[[w:Red River College|Red River College]]\n</gallery>"
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
